GitHub's own answers of "list workflow runs for a repository" (GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/runs),
read from bats-lang/quire on 2026-10-26 (the runs of quire#869's queue entries, quire#879), one file for
each case of ../check.sh. Each is the answer as GitHub gave it, with the members the decision does not read
and that name people removed (jq -S, del(.workflow_runs[] | .repository, .head_repository, .actor,
.triggering_actor, .head_commit, .pull_requests)), so the files are small and carry no one's details.

